#: hmib_types.php
msgid "The Host Type is determined by scanning its snmp agent for the sysObjectID and sysDescription and comparing it against values in the Host Types database.  The first match that is found in the database is used aggregate Host data.  Therefore, it is very important that you select valid sysObjectID, sysDescrMatch for your Hosts."
msgstr "Aina ya Kipangishi hubainishwa kwa kukagua wakala wake wa snmp kwa sysObjectID na sysDescription na kuzilinganisha na thamani katika hifadhidata ya Aina za Vipangishi.  Uoanishaji wa kwanza unaopatikana katika hifadhidata hutumika kukusanya data ya Kipangishi.  Kwa hivyo, ni muhimu sana uchague sysObjectID na sysDescrMatch halali kwa Vipangishi vyako."

