#: hmib_types.php
#, php-format
msgid "Provide key information to help HMIB detect the type of Host.  SQL Where expressions are supported.  SQL Where wildcard character is the '%' sign. Regular Expressions have been removed due to compatibility issues."
msgstr "Toa maelezo muhimu ili kusaidia HMIB kutambua aina ya Kipangishi.  Misemo ya SQL Where inatumika.  Alama ya kadi-mwitu ya SQL Where ni '%' sawa na ishara ya asilimia. Misemo ya Kawaida (Regular Expressions) imeondolewa kwa sababu ya matatizo ya uoanifu."

